      ],
      "source": "https://westpoint.ky.gov/Pages/Tourism.aspx"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "West Point recently rehabilitated a 1926 Rosenwald School, which was built to educate African Americans in rural areas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
